ishtaria-server (0.4.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Walking matches the client's water: ground below sea level in a dry
    cell is land, so there is no invisible water to drown in (on the
    road to Uruk).
  * A trapper sets as many snares as he carries; each one Enkidu ruins
    moves the quest on, and a replacement comes only when none is left
    (migration 0059).
  * Places a quest sent the player to stay on the map and compass as
    known places (migration 0060).
  * Herbivores struck by a hunter run off 45 m, rest and walk back;
    predators always bite back.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <cybervitexus@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 03:11:15 +0100

